            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">This dataset describes the production of an internal combustion engine (ICE) for a passenger car. The entries are given per kg engine. The original data has been derived for an ICE of approximately 275kg. The information described in this dataset has been obtained starting from the "Life Cycle Inventory of the Golf A4" made by Schweimer and Levin.  The final dataset has been published in Althaus and Gauch: "Vergleichende Oekobilanz der Elektromobilität: Elektromobilität bersus konventionelle Mobilität mit Bio- und fossilen Treibstoffen".;
